			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="0" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Given impedance and propagation delay, find the inductance per inch:</p>
